  "abstract": "This package was developed from Chang Cheng's original two-stage SGD-DWD research scripts accompanying his dissertation. It implements the methodology in Chapter 3 using stochastic gradient descent (SGD): projected linear SGD followed by selection using absolute decision scores and RKHS kernel SGD.",
